# Phyrexian Unlife (CR 104.3b, 704.5a): Bot1 is Bolted from 1 life to -2 and stays in the game while Unlife is on the
# battlefield. When Bot2 Disenchants it, the next state-based action check finds Bot1 at 0 or less life with nothing saying
# they don't lose, and Bot1 loses (the 2011-06-01 ruling).

[Life]
Bot1: 1

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Plains
Sol Ring
Mox Pearl
Phyrexian Unlife
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Plains
Plains
Lightning Bolt
Disenchant
Island
Island
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Phyrexian Unlife.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Life = -2
? Result = InProgress
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Disenchant.Cast(Phyrexian Unlife)

[Expect]
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.Status = Lost
Bot1.LostTo = Life
